<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page food-library-page qd-theme qd-diary"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CARE, A LITTLE CLEAR</view><view class="row"><view class="library-heading">这一餐，心里有数</view><button class="library-favorites" bindtap="toggleFavorites">{{favoritesOnly?'查看全部 ›':'我的收藏 ›'}}</button></view><view class="library-subtitle">食物、饮品与家常食谱，找到适合自己的搭配。</view><button class="library-calculation" bindtap="calculation">热量怎么算 ›</button><view class="library-search"><image class="library-search-icon" src="/images/ui/search.svg"/><input class="library-search-input" placeholder="搜索食物、饮品、食谱或运动" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/></view><view class="library-tabs"><button wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="key" class="library-tab {{tab===item.key?'library-tab-active':''}}" data-tab="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectTab">{{item.label}}</button></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="library-category-scroll"><view class="library-categories"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="key" class="library-category {{category===item.key?'library-category-active':''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="chooseCategory">{{item.label}}</button></view></scroll-view><view class="library-scroll-hint">左右滑动，查看更多分类 ›</view><view class="section-head mt"><text class="section-title">{{favoritesOnly?'我的收藏':tab==='foods'?'食物与饮品':tab==='recipes'?'家常食谱':'运动估算'}}</text><text class="small-text">{{totalCount}} {{tab==='activities'?'项':'款'}}</text></view><view class="library-list"><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="empty">{{favoritesOnly?'还没有对应收藏，点开喜欢的条目收藏吧。':'没有找到相关内容，换个关键词试试。'}}</view><view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="library-item"><button class="library-item-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="library-item-symbol"><image class="library-item-icon {{tab!=='activities'?'library-food-photo':''}}" src="{{item.iconPath}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="{{true}}"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="library-item-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="library-item-group">{{item.categoryLabel}}{{tab==='recipes'?' · 主食材实拍':''}}</view><view class="library-item-energy"><text class="library-energy-number">{{tab==='activities'?item.met:item.kcalLabel}}</text> {{tab==='activities'?'MET · 演示强度':tab==='recipes'?'千卡/份 · 参考配方':'千卡/100'+item.unit+' · 参考值'}}</view></view><text class="library-item-arrow">{{activeId===item.id?'⌃':'›'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{activeId===item.id}}" class="library-item-details"><view class="row"><view class="title">份量与记录</view><button class="library-item-favorite" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="favorite" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.favorite?'★ 已收藏':'☆ 收藏'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{item.conflicts && item.conflicts.length}}" class="notice warn mt">与你设置的限制相关：{{item.conflictsText}}，请核对实际配料。</view><view wx:if="{{tab==='recipes'}}"><text class="caption mt">{{item.time}} 分钟 · {{item.ingredientsText}}</text><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:key="*this" class="caption">{{index+1}}. {{item}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{tab!=='activities'}}" class="caption">蛋白质 {{item.protein}}g · 碳水 {{item.carb}}g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}}g / {{tab==='recipes'?'份':'100'+item.unit}}</view><button wx:if="{{tab!=='activities'}}" class="library-photo-source" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="photoSource">照片来源与许可 ›</button><view class="form-field mt"><text class="form-label">记录日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="picker">{{date}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">{{tab==='foods'?'实际份量 / '+item.unit:tab==='recipes'?'食用份数':'运动时长 / 分钟'}}</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="amount"/></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='activities'}}" class="form-field"><text class="form-label">本次体重 / kg，用于消耗估算</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" bindinput="weight"/></view><picker wx:else range="{{slots}}" value="{{slot}}" bindchange="slot"><view class="picker">{{slots[slot]}} ⌄</view></picker><button class="btn mt" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存到当天日记</button></view></view></view><button wx:if="{{shown.length < totalCount}}" class="library-more" bindtap="more">{{tab==='foods'?'查看更多食物与饮品':tab==='recipes'?'查看更多食谱':'查看更多运动'}}</button><view class="library-reference">食品营养与运动强度为本地记录示例。食物按每100克/毫升，食谱按配方每份估算；饮品的杯型、糖量、冰量和加料会影响数值，请以实际配料为准。</view></block></view>